      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "custom_class": "reverse",
        "second_heading": "Your monthlies <strong>journey.</strong>",
        "image_ratio": "adapt",
        "image_position": "center center",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "show_divider": false,
        "heading": "It’s not magic, it`s <strong>science</strong><em>.</em>",
        "description": "Healthy hormones require a steady supply of essential nutrients, along with supportive lifestyle habits, to function at their best.               That's why, <strong>after treating over 500 women and observing menstrual issues for over 10 years,</strong> our clinicians came together to create monthlies— a supplement tailored to replenish nutrient stores, support hormone balance, address menstrual symptoms, and promote overall well-being.",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "heading_alignment": "left",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "min_count": "30",
        "mid_count": "60",
        "max_count": "90",
        "count": "30",
        "title1": "<p>Experience the progress</p>",
        "text1": "<p><strong>In 30 days</strong>, you'll start noticing the powder's impact, with <strong> </strong>boosted energy and a gentle uplift in your mood.</p>",
        "title2": "<p>Unleash inner vitality</p>",
        "text2": "<p>In 60-days, you see <strong>tangible results:</strong> menstrual symptoms are mitigated, skin gains a healthy radiance, and you get balanced energy.</p>",
        "title3": "<p>Thrive in harmony</p>",
        "text3": "<p>In 90 days, <strong> you’ll feel reduced discomfort, and will enjoy </strong> a more regular cycle, heightened vitality and performance, radiant skin, and stable moods.</p>",
        "de_title1": "<p>Spüre die Verbesserung</p>",
        "de_text1": "<p><strong>Nach 30 Tagen</strong> wirst du die Wirkung des Pulvers erstmals spüren: mehr Energie und eine leichte Stimmungsaufhellung.</p>",
        "de_title2": "<p>Entfessle innere Vitalität</p>",
        "de_text2": "<p>In 60 Tagen wirst du spürbare <strong>Veränderungen bemerken: </strong>Menstruationsbeschwerden sind gelindert, deine Haut strahlt gesund und deine Energie ist ausgeglichen.</p>",
        "de_title3": "<p>Blühe in Harmonie auf</p>",
        "de_text3": "<p>In 90 Tagen wirst du dich über einen regelmäßigeren Zyklus, mehr Vitalität und Leistungsfähigkeit, strahlende Haut und ausgeglichene Stimmung freuen.</p>",
        "mobile_text_alignment": "left",
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "swipe_on_mobile": false,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "timeline_section_BMXLi4": {
      "type": "timeline-section",
      "blocks": {
        "cycle_KxrzgP": {
          "type": "cycle",
          "settings": {
            "cycle_heading": "Cycle 1",
            "cycle_text": "<p>In your first month with monthlies, your body starts replenishing essential nutrients to support <strong>steadier energy, improved sleep, and a balanced mood</strong>. Early hormonal adjustments uniquely <strong>target bloating and digestive sluggishness, normalising oestrogen metabolism and fluid balance</strong>, and laying the groundwork for deeper hormonal recalibration ahead.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "cycle_KwNBAV": {
          "type": "cycle",
          "settings": {
            "cycle_heading": "Cycle 2",
            "cycle_text": "<p>By the second month, hormonal pathways stabilise, <strong>reducing bloating, water retention, and mood swings</strong>. Improved harmony between oestrogen and progesterone results in more controlled prostaglandin production, <strong>easing cramps and inflammation</strong>. Enhanced nutrient absorption supports <strong>smoother digestion and a more predictable cycle and fewer PMS symptoms</strong>.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "cycle_bCY3tb": {
          "type": "cycle",
          "settings": {
            "cycle_heading": "Cycle 3",
            "cycle_text": "<p>By this stage, your body has reached a deeper reset. <strong>Inflammation, hormonal imbalances, and prostaglandin surges are under control</strong>, leading to <strong>ease in cramps, stable weight, and improved cycle consistency</strong>. Other benefits are <strong>sustained energy, clearer skin, and smoother digestion</strong>, supporting overall hormonal resilience and smoother cycles in the long term.*</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "cycle_KxrzgP",
        "cycle_KwNBAV",
        "cycle_bCY3tb"
      ],
      "name": "Timeline section",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Feel the difference: <span>What you can expect</span> from monthlies journey.",
        "main_image": "shopify://shop_images/Picture_1.png",
        "cycle_paragraph": "<p>* These statements are based on scientific research on menstrual health, ingredients efficacy, and approved or on-hold EFSA claims. </p><p>References/studies here: <a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/monthlies-studies\" target=\"_blank\">https://tinyurl.com/monthlies-studies</a></p>"
      }
    },
