    "health_expert_JjA4J9": {
      "type": "health-expert",
      "blocks": {
        "column_TCPdWk": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Mask_group_51c61ace-f92c-4c03-89a7-e0900be94aeb.png",
            "title": "Dr. Ashley Florestal, ND",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>\"What I love about monthlies is its comprehensive yet targeted approach. The formula doesn't just support with period pain - it nourishes the entire hormonal system.\"</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "column_7LWYAe": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Image_1_e286a779-ad68-4924-b755-3087d82765ea.png",
            "title": "Dr.  Maria Obando, MD",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>“monthlies supports this vital system with 26 science-backed, natural ingredients, addressing root causes of symptoms like period pain, bloating, fatigue, and mood swings. It truly is a one-stop solution for menstrual wellness.”</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "column_kii4cx": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Geneva_rounded.png",
            "title": "Geneva Carrington, ND",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>“Even my healthiest patients - those who exercise regularly have dealt with menstrual challenges. Stress, nutritional deficiency, imbalances, and hormonal fluctuations can play a huge role.\"</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "column_6q6hpn": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Mask_group_7c446263-c740-4377-ab80-d2ea2f2ab069.png",
            "title": "Melissa Mastroberardino, RHN",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>“It’s astonishing how many women believe period pain is normal and ‘just part of being a woman.’ When women think of health, they often focus on weight, digestion, or skin, but rarely on cycles.\"</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        },
        "column_CGQCNV": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Mask_group_f7bd1080-63b8-4edd-908d-bd703b73708d.png",
            "title": "Dr. Cassandra Paiano, BSc,ND",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>“No two women experience their cycles the same way, which is why I appreciate the versatility of monthlies. Its formula is designed to address a variety of symptoms—from period pain and digestive discomfort to lack of energy and mood swings.”</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style_secondary": false
          }
        }
      },
