    "review_tU4NCm": {
      "type": "review",
      "blocks": {
        "reviews_GpDa4F": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Ich verwende monthlies jeden Morgen seit ca einem Monat und sehe jetzt schon tolle Ergebnisse! Ich habe schon lange nach etwas für meine hormonelle Gesundheit gesucht, da ich stark an Periodenschmerzen leide. Diese haben sich bereits deutlich reduziert und ich habe allgemein viel mehr Energie im Alltag. Ein plus Punkt ist ebenfalls meine Haut, die sich gut verbessert hat. Alles in einem ein tolles Produkt und sehr zu empfehlen!</p>",
            "name": "Karys",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_CpyKtC": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Ich habe so vieles gegen meine Periodenschmerzen probiert, aber nichts hat wirklich geholfen – bis ich Monthlies entdeckt habe. Das Produkt wirkt unglaublich gut, und die gesamte Erfahrung war top: schnelle Lieferung, tolles Packaging und eine super persönliche Beratung. Es macht endlich einen echten Unterschied, und ich bin so dankbar dafür. Absolute Empfehlung!</p>",
            "name": "Bea",
            "age": "28"
          }
        },
        "reviews_yUmK4M": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Would strongly recommend! I'm just finishing my second month and I can only say that my symptoms have reduced dramatically. After quitting my birth control pills, my pain got back and i needed to take painkillers all the time. To be honest, i completely lost the faith that something else could help. I can only say, very worth the price. Thanks monthlies for bringing my life back!</p>",
            "name": "Elizabeta",
            "age": "33"
          }
        },
        "reviews_4NqgQ9": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>A total Game-Changer for My Cycle!</p><p>I can’t say enough good things about Monthlies! After just a few weeks of taking this supplement, I’ve noticed a significant improvement in how I feel during my cycle. The cramps that used to keep me curled up on the couch are now much more manageable, and the bloating I dreaded every month has drastically reduced.<br/><br/>One of the things I love most is the natural formula. It feels great knowing I’m putting high-quality ingredients into my body, and it’s clear that a lot of thought went into creating something so effective. I also feel more balanced overall—fewer mood swings and way more energy, even during my toughest days.<br/><br/>If you struggle with any of the usual period symptoms, Monthlies is worth a try. It’s become an essential part of my routine, and I can’t imagine going through a cycle without it now!</p>",
            "name": "Maria",
            "age": "29"
          }
        },
        "reviews_8btFJb": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Bin sehr zufrieden damit</p><p>Ich hatte lange mit starken Menstruationsschmerzen zu kämpfen, die mich sehr eingeschränkt haben. Mit Monthlies, sind die Beschwerden deutlich erträglicher, und ich fühle mich wieder viel besser. Dieses Produkt hat mein Leben während der Periode viel leichter gemacht. Absolut empfehlenswert!</p>",
            "name": "C. Ionita",
            "age": "31"
          }
        },
        "reviews_XmTDqQ": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "4",
            "dsc": "<p>My period has now started and it has been the least painful and least messy one I've had in years - I had no pms symptoms to the point I was wondering if my period was even coming! I had some very mild cramping, that was only noticeable because I wasn't doing anything and then took half an aspirin the next day for a little bit of a backache. I'm very happy right now. </p>",
            "name": "Victoria",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_i8n7xX": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>Experienced heavy period pain for a couple of years now. Monthlies has helped me to reduce the physical strain of my periods. My hair and nails are fuller. </p>",
            "name": "Rachel",
