            "dsc": "<p>I’ve been using Monthlies and am beyond impressed. For years, I thought period pain was something I had to live with—it disrupted my life so much that even basic tasks felt impossible. Now, not only is the pain completely gone, but I also feel more energized, sleep better, and notice improved performance in my daily life. It’s amazing to finally live without suffering. Highly recommend!</p>",
